OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 13, who was struck by car,
OL,4,A'had smile that lit up a room', inquest
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe father of a 13-year-old girl who
OL,8,Fdied after being struck by a car as she
OL,9,Fgot off a school bus has told an
OL,10,Finquest they do not want any other
OL,11,Ffamily to suffer the same loss.
OL,13,FThe inquest into Caitlin Hogg's death
OL,14,Ffound she died on 8 December 2022, as a
OL,15,Fresult of a traumatic brain injury
OL,16,Fcaused by the collision two days
OL,17,Fearlier on the Moher Road, Kinawley, in
OL,18,FCounty Fermanagh.
OL,20,FCoroner Joe McCrisken delivered the
OL,21,Ffindings of the inquest at Enniskillen
OL,22,Fcourthouse on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
