OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 13, who was struck by car,
OL,4,A'had smile that lit up a room', inquest
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FCaitlin's father Bob Hogg addressed the
OL,8,Finquest when findings concluded and
OL,9,Fdescribed his daughter as a "beautiful
OL,10,Fgirl whose smile lit up the room".
